notes.content:
Added leaderboard to compete with other players and friends;
Fixed bug that prevented unlocking achievements;
Mac OSX platform is no longer supported, no updates there;

Christmas event! (22 Dec - 5 Jan):
[list]
[*] The following costumes from DLC are available during the event: Queen Girl, and Santa Boy; in order to wear an event costume select one in the Main Menu by using buttons above penguin; the presence of DLC or items in inventory are NOT required; 

[*] To play event levels click "[b]Merry Christmas[/b]" label in the Main Menu; all levels must be completed in one session, there is no save game between levels;

[*] Be sure to earn a special [b]Christmas badge[/b] into your collection (hint: collect stars as much as you can);
[/list]

Have fun and happy holidays to everyone!

The following changes will be introduced in game during Halloween event (26 Oct - 2 Nov):

[list]
[*] Three costumes are available: Cat Girl, Vamp Girl, and Bat Boy; in order to wear an event costume select one in the Main Menu by using buttons above penguin; the presence of DLC or items in inventory are NOT required; 

[*] Two boss levels are accessible by clicking "Happy Halloween" in the Main Menu;

[*] Special Halloween badge is granted for defeating event bosses;

[*] The screen turns dark red, but don't worry it will return to common light blue after Halloween is over;
[/list]

Additional changes (permanent): 

[list]
[*] Added config option "stacking" that controls how game manages items in inventory, for more details on this check the guide "Game files and config parameters"

[*] Now it's possible to exchange gold coins in the Main Menu: one coin for one random ball;[/list]

Version 1.19.6 what's new:
[list]
[*] fixed bug with shock/freeze time of Pengy, was dependent on Pengy's level, now depends on the level of foe only;
[*] fixed bug when the ball occasionally passed through the penguin as if it was transparent, causing ball to be lost; 
[*] fixed bug when unable to wear a DLC costume acquired from the market/trade; 
[*] added affect with new inventory items when item box opened during the play by pressing '0'
[/list]

[list]
[*] all inventory items removed from the game's item store;
[*] inventory items are organised in stacks when the game is running;
[*] added new inventory item -- item box; the item box is dropped every time when level is finished or the magic sphere gets filled, and drop time limits are satisfied; the item box can be opened and contains 3 random items out of 20+ items including accessories, balls, and power ups;
[*] added game status in Steam Chat when friends are playing;
[/list]

Version 1.19.4 what's new:
[list]
[*] fixed bug when music volume at 0% doesn't mute the music;
[*] added 10 inventory items, one for each Pengy's outfit from the Costume Pack DLC;
[/list]
